WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:16.904
Fleet settings choose how often devices check for updates and
send reports, and how much data they retain. These choices
affect freshness and operating cost. Daily reporting is not live
monitoring. Open Fleet settings to choose reporting and update
intervals.

2
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:22.419
Review the estimate, then save. Saving settings does not add
money to the budget.

3
00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:29.840
This small demo budget does not cover the estimate. Save anyway
records settings only; it adds no funds.

4
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.765
Devices apply settings at their next check. Network budget holds
their funds separately.

